  <item>
    <title>Vol25. 神奇寻亲之旅:2分钟找回失散70年的亲情</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681083f447ebeede7efacd58</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681083f447ebeede7efacd58</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 07:58:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你相信两分钟能找回70年的亲情吗？本期节目我们邀请到「跨越海峡的寻亲者」凯特和「神助攻」辣椒圈姐姐，与五哥一起来聊一聊神奇而又感人的寻亲故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>两岸相隔七十载，千里寻亲无音讯。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>血脉指引寒山寺，终归故里续前缘。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>当家谱上的名字和台湾户口本的口音误会完美吻合时，视频电话那头的姑姑哭喊着“终于找到你们了！”。原来30年一修的族谱、寒山寺的莫名召唤，都是冥冥中五位爷爷在天之灵的指引。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「找着找着突然就看懂了家的意义」</span></p><span></span><p><span>这趟旅程不仅让离散的血脉重聚，更让漂泊在台湾家人了解到了祖上也曾拥有【免死金牌】！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听这场关于「寻根」的神奇故事！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：五哥</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>特邀嘉宾：凯特、辣椒圈姐姐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">00:02:09</a>:故事主人公介绍：「我是台湾人，在北京工作」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">00:04:00</a>:两岸分隔70年，寻亲只需两分钟，历史奇妙得让人感叹。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">00:06:16</a>:父亲随口提出灵魂问题「我是谁，我从哪里来」，开启寻亲之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">00:14:20</a>:搜索引擎大显神威，辣椒圈姐姐神助攻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">00:22:18</a>:口音误会：爷爷名字被登记为「绍银」。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">00:29:32</a>:现代科技如神助，轻松找到家族老家！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">00:40:59</a>:姑姑视频通话中激动落泪，终于找到失散多年的亲人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">00:54:20</a>:就在这一刻，她终于回家了，故事圆满而温馨。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3576">00:59:36</a>:家族卧虎藏龙，书法家手写对联挂满墙！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4749">01:19:09</a>:我帮助父亲完成心愿，也找到了自己的起源。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>回到爷爷出生的老屋</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lngaQIarsES0uQ52mhPOeYJxmYqb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>盛大的家族团员</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsTm_YIeDlyH0FHKb2BouBR72YSL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>捧一把家乡的泥土</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvCZ1skQIpyw4Qjx85MY0GjlnoRg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙《五号电波Radio5》</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云音乐 《五号电台》</span></p>]]></description>
