    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>《五号电台》发布全新系列节目——《中国啤酒风云录》</span></h2><span></span><p><span>该系列我们将选取中国具有代表性的啤酒品牌，详细挖掘品牌背后的故事和发展历史，与大家一起来感受中国啤酒行业的兴衰成败。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期节目，我们选取了中国啤酒行业的代表品牌之一，西南地区啤酒之王——重庆啤酒。让我们一起来了解“重庆啤酒”堪比《甄嬛传》一样跌宕起伏的发展历程。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：五哥</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：《大小电波》古寺</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目较长，大家可以通过时间戳跳跃收听</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a></span></a><span> 欢迎《大小电波》主理人——古寺，一起来录制《中国啤酒风云录》系列。《大小电波》在北京的线下录音空间免费开放，欢迎大家预约使用。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a></span></a><span> 中国啤酒行业发展概览</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a></span></a><span> 重庆啤酒 | 第一回 &nbsp;&nbsp;嘉陵江畔酿新酒，山城啤酒显锋芒</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a></span></a><span> 重庆啤酒 | 第二回 &nbsp;&nbsp;跨界疫苗酿苦果，关灯吃面泪满襟</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a></span></a><span> 重庆啤酒 | 第三回 &nbsp;&nbsp;嘉士伯西进布棋局，重庆啤酒股权进入囊</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3&amp;voicelistId=794386414#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a></span></a><span> 重庆啤酒 | 第三回 &nbsp;&nbsp;品牌暗战风云起，山城啤酒叹飘零</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《中国啤酒风云录》系列将持续更新，欢迎朋友们评论留言，给我们提出更多的建议和意见！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
